REFRESH PROCEDURE
  1. Fetch the URL above with plain curl (no auth, no JS) and compare the md5
     with the first line of this file.
  2. Read Verze / Ze dne on the popis_struktury_detail page above and compare
     with the second line.
  3. If either moved: replace data/ossei1_epo2.xsd, update this file, update
     `structure_version` on the version record in data/cz_oss_version_data.xml
     (it is `noupdate`, so an existing database needs the field changed by a
     migration or by hand), and re-run the export tests.
  4. There is no changelog. Diffing the two XSDs is the only way to see what
     changed.
